error BYN1012: this expression does nothing as a statement

  2 │     a + b;
    │     ^^^^^ the value is computed and discarded
    │
  help: only calls, assignments and `++`/`--` can stand alone; to discard a call's result write `_ =
        f();`

error BYN1012: this expression does nothing as a statement

  3 │     a == b;
    │     ^^^^^^ the value is computed and discarded
    │
  help: only calls, assignments and `++`/`--` can stand alone; to discard a call's result write `_ =
        f();`
